    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9965eec1086b73a81a50c487",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便如此，若是……\n无法拭去心中的不安的话――",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e9f562bdab0d48a45d56873eafcad64433e3fffd20d1dee7a19e185e787974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
