    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c649c9ca41d601611a88a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "务必！拜托了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9d2737706e6570350d63c4d0fe58860e5c31601b64d53039b036d767f27eac6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d32e17bc5df0a25e9df918",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（喔喔喔喔喔喔喔！！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "843a9ed28cfce05bf1fce833803170f8339381f64685dd2da05763d359779a8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14c81e7e99331ab3e66d35b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "制霸了『育马者杯』、却依旧没有丝毫衰退的\n双腿，让红色梦想无论是在国内还是国外\n都征服了各种各样的考验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e421887ebef90e7ed821c6d86a22caba40c562119009e4fa08c778e9a0334e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d8b08633ca543b6116c2d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并且，红色梦想偶尔会去\n曼城茶座指引她的那片安息之地，\n对后辈马娘们进行指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d1418a51a0268e71a002b77ebdfbd366bbfde23a62a00049c9abfd50642acd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5495b05b45ee6d6bc0df0f81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仰慕着她、充满憧憬的一双双眼眸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d754d3930eb1203a93e9373f787a1fc42b782ff1fabd7f16b82fa4be9fe0269c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383bd1980fa1c48dc14da127",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这正是――从曼城茶座传承下来的，\n希望之种。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f409d3dc2144ebb32a907d1d6a1f8d66341728a878a9d21502d3fe47d827bd3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f49a2b7ce990e946a0c154a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "兼顾比赛和指导不会很辛苦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c20a75f36d6e62e63d1f96f807c384139ab57536635a2e15799001cead8eb7ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
