    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7660aeb2c0b8228bd274333d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "用这份生命，去赢下比赛。\n然后用这番身姿，\n去引领在后世闪耀的马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a37ba207c41bb1a96423ad123ba0372e30c07f88595dcc62410e51cd8b0f446",
